{"id":"155000003551","t":"Deactivating Calendar Groups","c":"48000449585","f":"155000000690","cn":"Calendars & Appointments","fn":"Calendar Groups (5)","m":"Thu, 10 Apr, 2025 at  3:59 PM","lm":"Thu, 10 Apr, 2025 at  3:59 PM","v":2,"w":54,"html":"\n            <p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zCylEQ39xqI?&amp;wmode=opaque\" loading=\"lazy\" allowfullscreen></iframe><br></p><p><br></p><p>You can deactivate a single group by clicking on the “<strong>ellipses</strong>” against the group which you wish to deactivate.</p><p>1. Clicking on the ellipses would open the <strong>options</strong> drawer</p><p>2. You can now see a new option “Deactivate all calendars in group” </p><p>3. Clicking on which would show a pop-up requesting confirmation</p><p><br></p><h2><strong><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48276466477/original/0ax-Wkbz53aRKwWdlabNLRApOxN_3tJb7g.png?1674136607\" loading=\"lazy\"><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48276467569/original/Dpqx_IScP_1EuZNQUxExninl-bVlw2GgBA.png?1674136786\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></strong></h2>\n            \n\n\n\n          "}